    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d265-a16">

                <pb facs="0493" n="393" sameAs="frus:frus1884/pg393"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 15.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State and of Foreign Affairs, Mexico, Political
                                Department</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1884-05-23"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">May</hi> 23, 1884</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have received your telegram of the 17th instant, referring to the visit that
                    was made to you by the commander of Fort Ringgold, to notify you of the order
                    which he has received from the Government at Washington to take possession of
                    the island of Morteritos. In answer, I inform you that our legation at
                    Washington has already been properly instructed respecting the matter.</p>
                <p>I renew to you my highest consideration.</p>
                <closer><signed>FERNANDEZ.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>To the <hi rendition="#italic">Consul of Mexico, at Roma, Tex</hi>.</p>
                    <p>A copy.</p>
                    <closer><signed>CAYETANO ROMERO,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Secretary.</hi></signed>
                        <lb/>
                        <dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                    >Washington, D. C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                                when="1884-06-12"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 12,
                            1884</date>.</dateline>
                    </closer>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
